   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HIVOS FOR THE ADELANTE CON LA DIVERSIDAD - BOLIVIA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Adelante con la Diversidad in Bolivia, implemented by Fundaci&#xf3;n Hivos, aims to promote LGBTIQ+ rights and strengthen the LGBTIQ+ movement. The objectives are to support advocacy, capacity-building, and grassroots initiatives. Key activities include the EMPODERA school, political advocacy, and funding for Pride marches, festivals, and investigative journalism, delivered in partnership with Adesproc Libertad, Colectivo Rebeld&#xed;a, and IGUAL across Bolivia&#x2019;s Llanos, Altiplano, and Valleys regions.</narrative>
  </description>
